To enable Apple Pay:
1. Log into https://developer.squareup.com
2. Go to your app > Apple Pay tab
3. Add domain: app.lstailors.com
4. Download the domain association file Square provides
5. Replace this file with the downloaded file (no extension, no modification)
6. Deploy — Vercel will serve it at /.well-known/apple-developer-merchantid-domain-association
7. Click Verify in Square Dashboard
